    "advancement": {},
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Lengthened Stride.</strong> Your Speed increases by 5 feet.</p><p><strong>Resilient Anatomy.</strong> You have Advantage on saving throws against effects that would force you to shape-shift against your will. In addition, when you fail a Constitution saving throw, you can take a Reaction to roll 1d4 and add the number rolled to the save, potentially turning the failure into a success. You can use this Reaction a number of times equal to your Proficiency Bonus, and you regain all expended uses when you finish a Long Rest.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-yW2jA60tcrfHbt3E\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>The Speed increase is automated; the Reaction rolls the bonus to add to the failed Constitution save.</p></section>",
